teach repos to depend on other repos

This is analogous to how rust crates have a Cargo.toml that lists
dependencies on other crates.

For example, a repo could have a repo.toml (?) that says something like:
```
[dependencies]
metric_fasteners = { git="https://github.com/taproot/metric_fasteners.git", version="1.0" }
```

This would be instead of running the job-compiler tool with a bunch of
`--repo PATH` arguments to local repos.
